+#[test]
+fn a_3d_finish_in_the_users_box_stock_reads_no_gouge_at_its_wall() {
+    // The issue's realistic setup: `lead_approach.rs`'s 70 x 70 x 27
+    // box at z -7, a 3D Finish with a 6 mm ball, kind defaults. Before
